{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:58 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:58 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:58 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"石硤尾邨夫婦爭執。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/4765b243a30280dc8c8ed7da2b22f1af/2026-10/page_153.jpg\"/><p>今日（21日）清晨6時28分，警方接獲石硤尾邨美山樓一名女子報案，指她與丈夫因感情問題爭執，其間丈夫情緒激動，她擔心對方會傷害自己。警員到場後，發現兩人平靜，沒有人受傷，經調查後列作糾紛案處理。</p><p>據了解，42歲姓蔡女事主因38歲姓張丈夫有外遇，雙方發生爭執，兩人拒絕轉介社工跟進事件。</p><img alt=\"美山樓夫婦發生爭執。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/67c6e606e627e9f0ac59d8ef30edc19f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_07_36_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/313ef830629fdbf84f4e78a52fdefa8b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_07_36_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/57e170e8bb23ba71be75add0972c89c7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_07_36_12_4_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是巴域街50號。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a1f199d3bd605522b58ae6c5fbf3f704/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_07_36_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5b3f846750b5f0b67339c38fe91738d3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_07_36_13.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a3d26ddfc8e781d9da3f32894907c85d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_07_36_12_5_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T01:59:51.705308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:58:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:57:58.105899+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:48.994019+00:00","content_hash":"e27a0da9ad939c1c0d90de99acfd22b8d3e01ecb0777102d580f53209309d42a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}